A majestic lion's head gazes out from the misty Scottish Highlands, set against a backdrop of rugged mountains and rolling hills. The ancient Celtic cross adorns the lion's forehead, symbolizing its status as a sacred animal in Scottish mythology. In the foreground, a kilted Highlander stands proudly, holding a sword with the Lion Rampant emblem emblazoned on its blade.
Mood: Noble and Regal
